      "note": [
        "2015 a new standard classification by institutional sector (INSEKT 2014) was introduced. This affects comparisons with older data.",
        "Data for Balance statistics is not revised at the same time as the Financial Accounts. This means that values for corresponding variables for the same period are not always the same.",
        "Eng",
        "This is a sample survey, called BAST. The survey consists of quarterly financial assets and liablilities for non-financial corporations. Note that this is not a complete balance sheet.  Corporations Foreign Trade Credits is not included here, see separate tabel in SSD. For the first quarter each year we have a new utdated population and a new sample.",
        "Data from the first quarter 2001 to the first quarter 2009 has been revised on the 16th of September 2009.",
        "Some caution should be exercised when interpreting the results as the data are based on relatively small sample sizes.",
        "The specifications for shares; subscription for new shares, redemption and provided /received share holder´s contribution have only values for transactions. Outstanding values can not exist (shown by zero)."
      ],
